{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fa0be29ddabea6b58fba57b19f40fa1e832786fc85f9a003b88528662a8f1164", "ja": "ジュリアは悩んでいた。歌を仕上げる自信は\nある。だが、それは静香に自分の流儀を\n押しつけることになるのでは、と。\nその迷いを千早に諭されたジュリアは、\n静香を信じてぶつかる覚悟を決める。", "zh": "茱莉亚很烦恼。\n她有自信完成歌曲，但很担心这样\n就必须强迫静香接受自己的做法。\n随后茱莉亚被千早点破心中的迷惘，\n下定决心要相信静香，全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2808d30a51f45293e6d30cec8d40d8606178af36e62dbc68cd9dfd9609e122ca", "ja": "（昨日はあの後、静香からの連絡はなかった。\n今朝もまだ姿は見えないが……）", "zh": "（昨天的事情过后，就一直没有接到静香的联络。\n今天早上也没看到她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ee7e008702f39860ecc8957ecfcaf90f5772e8067bf4f48d818b11a0d3c84b6f", "ja": "（いずれにせよ、明日の夜には再レコーディングだ。\nまずは、できるところまでやってもらうしか……ん？）", "zh": "（无论如何，明天晚上就要重新录音了。\n只能先请她们尽力而为……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "76c70c10aa64357fd040bc2b09979bb0d699f9281586fb86ae7abe1e3779e346", "ja": "……？\nこの歌は……？", "zh": "……？\n这首歌是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9ae5a7b010693beddc75f49163f5be5dfb9f3bf495c851f26c8499d28c2b573f", "ja": "やっぱり、ジュリアだったか。", "zh": "果然是茱莉亚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "319f89280e9713be0bbc9398598df3dcbcb41bc7e5ae55f26c785d2b031e6919", "ja": "……あんたか。ちょうどよかった。\nちょっと、話したいことがあったんだ。", "zh": "……是你啊，来得正好。\n我刚好有些话想和你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "78903fac298520eb7c3de29c0b913c779e00c7c44260f54ecdad222f2106c20d", "ja": "静香とのこと……だよな。\n再収録、やっぱりムリそうか？", "zh": "是和静香组团的事……没错吧？\n重新录音，真的没希望了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ab92f649980e7a0e706b6f10faaa5f7083463d9dbafd937ea43a04ae9cc1a8b", "ja": "どうかな……。あたしは自信があるんだけどな。\n明日の夜にはゼッタイ間に合うって、今でも思ってる。", "zh": "很难说……我是很有自信。\n我现在还是觉得明天晚上一定来得及。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "a359753ef3637248e63e31f1c33b21034f73d7caea5f41194cc77d92013caff2", "ja": "イメージがあるんだよ。そのつもりでシズと歌えば、\nきっとスグに……ウチらのロックが見つかると思う。", "zh": "我有明确的想法，只要照那想法和静合唱，\n一定马上……就能找出属于我们的摇滚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "f5fad2b4ef0ddae0dd485ac440b258a92753889fabca7db10d53ea1a27aab793", "ja": "なんなら明日の夜がぶっつけ本番になっても、どうにか\nなる気がしてる。…シズとなら、なんとかなるってね。", "zh": "就算要我们明天晚上直接正式表演，\n我也觉得没问题……我就是觉得和静一定能搞定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "395604cd40adc585aa60735c7c8543cae02851c69334c6f29167b420e4dc00ab", "ja": "すごいな。そこまで自信があるなら、\n俺も安心だけど……。", "zh": "真厉害。\n既然你这么有自信，那我也放心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "46b6fecb928372982f0c4d9dda49cd8ded54edf882962a47528ea3e17fab7b3c", "ja": "ただ……。なあ、{$P$}。", "zh": "只是……我问你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "8f32f00c1597327e826a5fda8b9999b87eb0411c8bcabbbc834aa81bb590d6b2", "ja": "それって本当に、シズのためになるのか？", "zh": "这样子对静真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "15b948d54a5becacbe8d59458e503daf95088c75f1a35691dd84e6f45528c726", "ja": "思っちまったんだ。シズの目指すアイドルって、\nあたしのロックとは違うんじゃないか……ってね。", "zh": "我不禁会想，静心目中的偶像，\n会不会跟我对摇滚的看法不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7871d6b699fac4b7aa95a977a8d3ae0061720d83f9f3ad1f2a31af1f1e6d08e", "ja": "見てればわかるんだよ。シズはたぶん……。\nこの劇場で一番、アイドルに真剣だ。", "zh": "明眼人都看得出来，静她……\n大概是我们剧场里最认真看待偶像事业的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d53ed8be690a51ac46dcc4f2fe5e02e6a4dc2528abd206397dcb09bb05cbb7c9", "ja": "……そうだな。\n静香がアイドルに真剣なのは、確かだと思う。", "zh": "……是啊。\n我也认为静香的确对偶像这条路很认真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "82316df0ab0dbf81c5b282a93855ec0972950c8c777a0710a8eb005f7e172236", "ja": "もちろん、あたしだって真剣だぜ？　でも、\nあの子にとってのアイドルは、そういうのじゃない。", "zh": "当然，我也是很认真的。\n不过，偶像对她来说，不只如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "e404514e1e09d7cfe21a92b22125c19c49ce82f54dd5e5a558fad9c0c50817c2", "ja": "あたしにとってのロックとも違う。\nシズは、たぶん……もっと……。", "zh": "这与我对摇滚的情感又有所不同，\n静她大概……更加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "c59eb4905e0667cf1468efac1065f1376e3ac2ad3c70fd137ac2b899298336a0", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。\n今回のあたしとのユニットに、シズを……。", "zh": "我问你，{$P$}。\n这次组成的团体，我让静……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "fdbcb81871c89dc38260aa493d23a29d242b164b1e16465f524f3e1c8a4f6ca6", "ja": "あたしのロックに、あの子を染めていいのか？", "zh": "让静染上我的摇滚颜色，这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "98b7e3ed3432d5db0d632484b60babd3f79a0e6ed9f704205a78209306e4ca4d", "ja": "ジュリア……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "364054c62d76d005c4f79cd4d67ea0634f9235f8f76d1eaf66476f14ca91e20a", "ja": "ふざけないで。", "zh": "请不要开玩笑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "b0dad9f8134821e91d468d1cca569f05eb4b8507a5e6e165c3074318369cbb2c", "ja": "って、チハ！？", "zh": "哇！千！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "26f6ac067fe0f77bc76060c26a1a26abb60dd9e520c82f1e3e7968bfb0bd4978", "ja": "千早？　……あ！", "zh": "千早……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "01108112e82648e6b777addd5e9dc6a8f7beada7d435ecb5fb144a5b1541303b", "ja": "急にどうしたんだ？\nなんでこんなトコに……？", "zh": "你怎么突然冒出来？\n为什么会出现在这里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "4a018131542ce19e8690c05d7a1f59425655aec451085eaab2a1cb2c1b0ec53b", "ja": "待ち合わせって言ったのに、来ないから\n探しに来たのよ。今日は私と撮影の仕事でしょう？", "zh": "明明约了要碰面却没看到你，所以我才来找人。\n今天不是有和我一起摄影的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "bae8dc262794cf4499313387aeb92f6b38c3853fa23adfae6a3e46f2231e40da", "ja": "あっ。……あああっ、そうだった！", "zh": "啊……啊啊啊！我都忘了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "2bfb94e96c68463be5c7ae3ef2d96c6e609fdc3b1f4c2b1fe2cb5c73d25b313a", "ja": "そうだよな。ごめん千早、\n俺もつい、気が逸れて……。", "zh": "我也忘了，抱歉，千早，\n我也不小心分神了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "4e852e6676fc6c27acd7df44028f348dc463c1547edce55177047943634afaa7", "ja": "いえ、仕方ないかと。そのことはいいんです。\nそれより……ジュリア。あなたの音楽はその程度なの？", "zh": "没关系，这也是没办法的事，不用再道歉了。\n更重要的是……茱莉亚，你的音乐只有这种程度吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "b0975f803fe370203e47b2eb2b99f8d4129afbcbd09344fc7635520f6b03bb0c", "ja": "誰かに遠慮しなくてはいけないもの？\n誰かを巻き込んでは可哀想なもの？", "zh": "你的歌声非得顾虑到别人吗？\n你觉得影响了别人，很过意不去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "cec25e739a8e59b3c81734f7798685af7303a354d073815f01dfede9070b0a58", "ja": "誰かの夢を壊してしまうものなの？\n違うでしょう？", "zh": "你的歌声会糟蹋别人的梦想吗？\n不会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "1281097a49364573aeacfab6d480cb87fa7d449b741aac14196ba380c285688f", "ja": "歌は、夢を見せるもの。夢をあらわすもの。\n心を震わすもの。心に寄り添うもの……。", "zh": "歌声为人带来梦想，是梦想的体现。\n歌声触动心灵，是心灵的依靠……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "9f7a1c0aa20f4700e0507acf869aeb6d0f08b00f8d1ee210c9842bf45f53e2eb", "ja": "どんな歌でも、それは同じはず。", "zh": "无论是什么样的歌，应该都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "44eef06f40ec2ab37b8c2fb5191fb41f54a296c03426f543291aae6db4981460", "ja": "チハ……。", "zh": "千……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "1ef0df87120747c059ef5f7dd245af9de48fc7b02f763fb12ade00d0f07e907d", "ja": "そんな、歌を心のままに歌うあなたを、私は尊敬して\nいるわ。仲間として、誇りにすら思ってる。", "zh": "我很尊敬随心所欲唱歌的你。\n身为你的伙伴，我甚至觉得非常骄傲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "4c834142c7f77f552d27bdfb0644e45cc84b819bb452fd3c848a92c29220fc78", "ja": "でも、私以上にそう思っていたのは誰なのか……。\nあなたも、よく知っているはずよ。", "zh": "可是，有个人比我更尊敬你、更以你为荣……\n你应该也很清楚她是谁吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "647e6e24c45605975e7fa262d2a86977b40e4f91935a1a1dfaa55b9082ee3b36", "ja": "……そういえば、ジュリアとのユニットを\n発表した時も、うれしそうだったな。", "zh": "……这么一说，我发表她将和茱莉亚组成团体时，\n她看起来也很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "0777c8debd82137da127efc672494337e7d848a9f059ce7ed47dea1eabddbe38", "ja": "（喜びと期待に、目を輝かせて……）", "zh": "（眼神里充满了喜悦与期待的光芒……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "2283f0b99930e5a667eb03f4b8319d0e11acac9a1798133d431f5ad75e86ea29", "ja": "……ははっ。まいった……。\nそうだよな。何をらしくないこと言ってんだか！", "zh": "……哈哈！伤脑筋……\n的确是这样，我怎么会说这种反常的话！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "ba20a77b436db767d2b237bdb5c9025ed5128662c1ae3b4d1b04e99773db7e37", "ja": "せっかく、ロックに決めるチャンスだってのに。\n突っ走らないでどうするって話だよな！", "zh": "难得有机会可以好好摇滚一番，\n怎么可以不全力冲刺呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1044_002chi", "source_sha256": "eabedf65579136cb585612a3c97e8add7ffd76f80e94195f6c05baad63e9a40c", "ja": "ふふ、そうね。\nそれから、もうひとつ。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n另外，还有一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1045_002chi", "source_sha256": "5a7c46e273a5ae551c01441ba9e37df066c87d91045df320ff4a96af869fbd91", "ja": "そう簡単にあなたの色に染まるほど、\nあの子は甘くないと思うけれど。", "zh": "我想她不会轻易就染上你的颜色，\n她没有那么容易受影响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "83e88ae43e180595dd31c12d3f1489a55e1642369bfb467db7180497a9455bba", "ja": "……。\nはっ、確かにそうかもな！", "zh": "……\n哈！说得也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "11fd9bb1690370d44a6341e0c09cd1f3806b8e89311bf57f4fa5a5f86d693b54", "ja": "サンキュ、チハ！　おかげで目が覚めた。\nなんつーか、いろいろ考えすぎてたぜ。", "zh": "谢啦，千！你让我清醒了。\n该怎么说呢？我实在是想太多啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "be52c13ce0334ee3ebef78003276a73d8785e999058d705baf338f85731e6181", "ja": "OK、やってやるさ。あたしのありのままを\n思いっきりシズにぶつけて……。", "zh": "OK，我就全力以赴吧。\n我会毫无保留，尽全力与静对唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1049_050jul", "source_sha256": "bdffc162ca28543a4a0b5fb4a8d37ce39ac9e4c0c2670bc94a082e28ef1ccc88", "ja": "ウチらだけの歌を、作り上げてみせる。\n期待しててくれよ！", "zh": "创造出属于我们的歌。\n拭目以待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1050_002chi", "source_sha256": "3674efd8ff11399433d135921ea6c63954e25aeda7d780e42fedfbef407c2126", "ja": "……ええ、心から楽しみにしているわ。\nでもその前に、今日の撮影の仕事をきっちりと。", "zh": "……好的，我打从心里期待喔。\n不过在那之前，得先好好完成今天的摄影工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1051_050jul", "source_sha256": "6adf8ade59f4ebe162e4fe5f9bfd6ac3d32a7c4007d89a9be1bfcfde7c8b1c9d", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうだった。せっかくロックな気分\nなのに、またフリフリの服を着るのか……。", "zh": "喔、喔喔，我又差点忘了。\n亏我现在心情这么摇滚，待会又要穿上飘逸的服装吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1052_002chi", "source_sha256": "041c26e84c1769f9c0a87ba62d4bbe03b215debe5cea4b7f6202d23b7dfec0c5", "ja": "ふふっ、遅刻したら、それだけ終わるのが\n遅くなるわよ。急ぎましょう。", "zh": "呵呵，要是迟到的话，也会延后收工喔。\n赶快过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1053_050jul", "source_sha256": "c3ff4911dc989a025a62cff667b8e4b8756a10d2975b282daccb8cc86c89b4cd", "ja": "わかったよ。よし、今日は一発でキメてやる。\nフリルでもリボンでもかかってこい！", "zh": "我知道啦。好，今天也要一次收工。\n不管是荷叶边还是蝴蝶结，通通放马过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_04_1054_p", "source_sha256": "913796c2e2219becbc0a51a3cf4cfa5816c668c52cb5d5abb2dfcda950a90f94", "ja": "（ジュリアの表情から、迷いの陰りは消えた。\nでも、もう一人……。静香とも向き合わないと）", "zh": "（茱莉亚的表情中已经没有半点迷惘。\n不过，还有另一位……还得去面对静香才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
